0,Indo-European languages - Wikipedia,https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Indo-European_languages,"The proposed Proto-Indo-European language (PIE) is the reconstructed common ancestor of the Indo-European languages, spoken by the Proto-Indo-Europeans. During the 1960s, knowledge of Anatolian became certain enough to establish its relationship to PIE.",Wymysorys,Indo-European
